<BlogPost
  title="Is Dairy Queen Soft Serve Real Ice Cream? Explained"
  description="Why Dairy Queen calls it soft serve, not ice cream: the FDA 10% milkfat rule, what DQ soft serve is made of, and how it compares to ice cream."
  h1="Is Dairy Queen Soft Serve Real Ice Cream?"
  crumb="Is DQ Soft Serve Ice Cream?"
  eyebrow="Explainer"
  image="/Images/vanilla-soft-serve-cone.webp"
  imageAlt="Dairy Queen vanilla soft serve cone with the classic curl on top"
